*tips/hints to help player learn the games controls. if tips are enabled, player must perform the action that the tip describes to close the related
dialogue box. dynamically update the input method based on wether they are using gamepad or keeb*

[TIP 1]
NARRATOR: Press **summon spear** to summon your weapon
[END]

[TIP 2] - triggered as soon as an enemy is in range
NARRATOR: Press **throw spear** to throw your weapon at an enemy. It will automatically target the closest foe.
[END]

[TIP 3] 
NARRATOR: Press **throw spear** and then **teleport** to instantly transmit yor body to your weapons location. if you slam into a foe, it will deal great damage
[END]

[TIP 4] - triggered when the decorative sign is in view
NARRATOR: your weapon can target certain objects too. This allows you to teleport through platforms. Try it on that sign.
[END]